      "official_mark_scheme_text": "State or imply $\\ln y=\\ln a+x\\ln b$ — B1.\n\nCarry out a completely correct method for finding $\\ln a$ or $\\ln b$ — M1: $3.7=\\ln a+\\ln b$ and $6.46=\\ln a+2.2\\ln b$, leading to $\\ln a=1.4$ and $\\ln b=2.3$.\n\nObtain $a=4.06$ — A1.\n\nObtain $b=9.97$ — A1. Guidance: SC B1 for $a=e^{1.4}$ and $b=e^{2.3}$.\n\nAlternative method: $e^{3.7}=ab$ and $e^{6.46}=ab^{2.2}$ — B1; divide to obtain $e^{2.76}=b^{1.2}$ and state or imply $2.76=1.2\\ln b$ — M1; obtain $a=4.06$ — A1 and $b=9.97$ — A1.\n\nTotal: 4",
